SUMMARY: Serendipity Brunch: The 50-Plus Edition
LOCATION:The Terrace
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\, Food & Beverage\nPrice: $65.00 per per
 son\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/ev
 ents/199238\n\nStep into a lively Saturday brunch designed for members in 
 their 50s and beyond—where meaningful connections come naturally and con
 versation flows as effortlessly as the mimosas. This edition of Serendipit
 y Brunch invites you to gather in The Terrace for a relaxed yet engaging s
 tart to the day alongside fellow members at a similar stage of life.\n\nTh
 e experience unfolds at an easy\, social pace: a thoughtfully curated\, fa
 mily-style menu paired with subtle conversation prompts designed to spark 
 connection and keep dialogue flowing. Enjoy a table of pastries\, fresh fr
 uit\, and parfaits to begin\, followed by your choice of entrée and gener
 ous sides\, with Bloody Marys and mimosas available throughout.\n\nWhether
  you’re looking to expand your social circle\, make a new friend\, or si
 mply enjoy meeting someone unexpected\, it’s a refined\, convivial take 
 on brunch at The ’House—welcoming\, engaging\, and designed for great 
 conversation\, new connections\, and a little serendipity.\n\n*Tickets are
  $65 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. Cancellati
 ons within 72 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will be charged 
 in full. Please inform us of any dietary needs or restrictions by emailing
  happening@thequin.com at least 72 hours prior to the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/199238
CATEGORIES:Member Mixer,Food & Beverage
