DESCRIPTION:Category: Sports & Games\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 12 spots l
 eft\nStatus: You are on Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.
 com/events/201347\n\n2:00PM Pro-Led Instruction\, 2:30PM Open Play\, 4:00P
 M - Recovery and Member Mingling\n\nJoin us for an offsite afternoon of pl
 ay as The 'Quin House takes over the courts at Ballers in the Seaport. Whe
 ther you're picking up the racquet for the first time\, or have tried the 
