 tructors Johny Mario\, Ballers Head Pickleball Pro\, and Leo Justus\, Gene
 ral Manager and Padel Pro\, giving members guidance before moving into rot
 ating play and friendly matches across both sports\, guided by the Ballers
  team. Members will have the opportunity to rotate between pickleball and 
 padel courts to experience both racquet sports with pros and members. Post
  play\, members can stick around to mix\, mingle\, and enjoy food and drin
 ks for purchase at the Ballers food trucks and bar. After play\, members 
