 ft\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/
 202196\n\nPull up a chair for Pub Table Bridge\, a relaxed afternoon of ca
 rds\, conversation\, and friendly competition among fellow members and gue
 sts. With an open-play format and an easygoing pace\, the afternoon is des
 igned for those who enjoy the strategy and social ritual of bridge - witho
 ut the formality of tournament play.\n\nBest suited to members with a work
 ing knowledge of the game\, the afternoon invites you to settle in for a f
 ew hands\, reconnect with familiar faces\, and meet new ones across the ta
 ble. \n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members\, plus one
