 Event URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/201624\n\nSpend the eve
 ning with acclaimed guitarist and composer Bill Banfield\, whose distincti
 ve sound brings together jazz\, classical\, and contemporary influences. S
 ettle in for a polished live performance showcasing his artistry\, versati
 lity\, and singular approach to the guitar.\n\nEnjoy the music with a sign
 ature cocktail from Little Bar\, and let the evening’s artistry set the 
 tone for a memorable night at the ’House.\n\n*Please note this event is 
 reserved for members\, plus three guests. Seating is first come\, first se
 rved.
